      "message": "So from the patch description I follow you\u0027re installing the ashmem_compat_fops, and you\u0027re exporting the memfd_flip_create for future use. But this big chunk prior to calling __memfd_flip_create() isn\u0027t trivially obvious. It seems like it duplicates some of the logic in memfd_create()? Should this be broken out to a separate helper added in a earlier patch instead?",
